# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Godot 4.x
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Editor-generated cache, import database, and per-user editor state.
# Fully regenerated by the editor (or `godot --headless --import`) on the
# next import; never needs to be committed.
.godot/

# Auto-generated translation binaries built from CSV source files.
*.translation

# Export preset credentials (keystore passwords, signing keys, API tokens,
# etc.), written locally by the editor when you configure an export preset.
# export_presets.cfg itself is plain config and safe to commit -- this file
# is not.
export_credentials.cfg

# NOTE: *.import files are intentionally NOT ignored. Godot expects them to
# be committed alongside the source assets they describe (they record the
# importer settings and the path to the generated cache in .godot/imported).

# Exported build output (APK/IPA and related files) produced by
# Project > Export. Regenerate locally with the Godot editor; see MOBILE.md.
builds/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
